<title>USA: Handleman names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Handleman names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Handleman Co, which supplies and merchandises music, video, books and personal computer software to leading retail chains, said Thursday it named Leonard Brams as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Brams was formerly vice president/administration and chief financial officer for Detroit-based Talon LLC.</p>
<p>He replaces Rich Morris, who resigned to accept a position with a privately-held company in New Jersey.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
